{"id":"chatcmpl-6acd350bee746671aa9aba78","object":"chat.completion","created":1791833355,"model":"kimi-k3","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"شَرْط — parsed.\n\n**شَرْط (sharṭ)** — *condition, stipulation, prerequisite*\n\n- **Root:** ش-ر-ط\n- **Meaning:** A condition that must be fulfilled for something else to occur; a stipulation in an agreement or contract.\n- **Examples:**\n  - شَرْطُ القَبُولِ — the condition for acceptance\n  - بِشَرْطِ أَنْ... — on the condition that...\n  - الشُّرُوط وَالأَحْكَام — terms and conditions\n- **In grammar:** شَرْط refers to conditional sentences (جُمْلَة الشَّرْط), introduced by particles like إِنْ، إِذَا، مَنْ، مَا.\n\nWhat would you like rendered next?","reasoning_content":"Parse شَرْط = \"condition\". Render the meaning."},"finish_reason":"stop"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":152,"completion_tokens":221,"total_tokens":373,"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":15},"prompt_tokens_details":{"cache_write_tokens":0}}}